project (id) (rows≈2 cost≈4.2K)
└─ join inner residual (! (< |t.id| __scalar_0__)) (rows≈2 cost≈4.2K)
   ├─ source t AS t (rows≈4 cost≈32)
   └─ project (__scalar_0__) (rows≈1 cost≈40)
      └─ filter (> |u.x| 100) (rows≈1 cost≈32)
         └─ source u AS u row-groups (> |u.x| 100) (rows≈2 cost≈16)
